<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nineveh khua kong bia: Elkosh khuami Nahum nih langhnak a hmuhmi ṭialnak cauk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu a nah a chuakmi Pathian a si, phuhlam a duhmi Pathian a si; Bawipa nih cun phu a hlam hna i khulrang in a thin a hung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu phuchim le ṭotho in a kal i khuadawm hna cu a ke toi i leidip an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rili kha a sik i a carter dih, tiva vialte kha a kaoter dih hna. Bashan le Karmel cu an uai i Lebanon i thing corh no hna cu an car.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hmaiah tlang pipi kha an i hnih i tlang hme deuhdeuh hna kha an i let, A hmaiah vawlei le a cung i a ummi vialte hna cu i tuaibur in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahodah a thinhunnak hmaika ah cun a dir kho lai? Aho nih dah a thinlinhnak cu an dawnh khawh lai? A thinhunnak cu mei tiva bantukin a luang i a hmaiah lung hna cu an ti dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harnak caan ah amah aa bochanmi caah cun Bawipa cu a fekmi himnak a si; Amah nih ka chanh seh, ti a duhmi paoh cu a zohkhenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tilian nih thil a hrawh bantukin a hrawh hna i Sihmanhsehlaw amah a dohtu a ral hna cu khuamui chungah a dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeicahdah Bawipa dohnak na tuah? Na donghnak an phakter lai; Ahohmanh nih voi hnih an do kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hling nih a ngerhmi le zuri bantuk le a romi capawl bantukin na kang dih lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nineveh, nangmah chungin fimchimtu ṭhalo pakhat a chuak i Bawipa dohnak khua kha a khan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hihi Bawipa nih a mi Israel mi hna sinah a chimmi cu a si; “Assiria mi cu ṭhawng in tam hna hmanh seh law an rawk lai i an lo lai. Ka mi hna, harnak kan inter hna, sihmanhsehlaw kan inter ti hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Assiria nih nan hngawng ah an in banhmi hna hngawngkual kha ka khiah lai i an in khih hnanak cikcin kha ka chah lai, tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Assiria mi kong ah Bawipa nih hitihin nawlbia a chuah; “Phuntungtu ngei loin ka tuah hna lai. An Pathian hna biakinn chung milem vialte kha, suaimi he thletmi he, ka hrawh dih hna lai. Nannih Assiria mi hna, nan caah thlan ka co lio — nun awk nan i tlak lo, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zohhmanh u! Thawngṭha a rak phortu ke khi tlang cungin a ra lio! Teinak thawng kha amah nih cun a thanh lai. Judah mi hna, nan puai cu tuah hna u law Pathian sinah nan i kammi kha pe u, Miṭhalo nih nan ram kha an luhhnawh ti lai lo. Annih cu hrawh dih cikcek an si cang,
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kulhnak ralhau i ralvennak hrawhnak ding caah ralhau chimhnak kha chiahhnawh na si cang, Na ralhau kha veng hna. Lam kha hei zoh law tuk awk i tim. Na thazang dihlak in chuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Bawipa nih Jakob sunparnak le Israel rumra cu a pek ṭhan lio a si; ramhtu nih khan an rak ramh hna i an nge kha an rak phet dih ko nain).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ralkap hna phaw cu a sen in an sen, An ralkap hna cu a sen lawng tein an i thuam; An rangleng hna cu artlang in an chiah hna tikah meizik bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Raltuknak rang hna nih cun a bubu in khualipi cu an hun nam lulhmalh; Khua pawngri ah cun pakhat le pakhat kha an i eng, Meifar tom lekmi bantuk khi an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hruitu hna nih khan an ralṭhatnak kha an langhter, Nimtlau bantukin a kenkip ah a choi in an choi; Khulrang in vampang ah khan an hei tli i raltuknak phaw kha an va chon hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tiva luannak phihnak kha an phongh hna i siangpahrang inn cu a tlu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrangnu kha an tlaih i A sal ngaknu hna cu an kalpi hna i ṭhuro bangin hram lengmang in an ṭang kha an i cum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Nineveh cu tidil bantuk ah a cang, A velchum i a ummi ti a zor lengmangmi bantuk kha a si cang. “Dir tuah, dir tuah,” tiah an au, sihmanhsehlaw pakhat hmanh an i mer lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hranchaw cu an lak hna, ngun le sui hranchaw hna cu; Thil an rak khonmi cu dongh a thiam lo, minung nih an duhmi thil man fak bikbik nih a phak lomi rothil an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ramh hna, an rok hna, an hlih cikcek hna! An ralṭhatnak cu ti bantuk ah a cang i an khuk cu a ther dih, An kutke cu a tom dih hna i an hmai cu a daang dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuazei ah dah atu cu chiandeih kua kha a um? Chiandeih fa an bawhnak lungkua kha khuazei ah dah a um? Chiandeih a pa le a pi le an fale rual, ṭihnak zeihmanh ngei loin an i chawh thluaimai tawnnak hmun kha khuazei ah dah a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kha chiandeih nih khan a fale caah khan sa cu a seh i Chiandeih pi caah khan sa cu a thleh a baoh i A kua cu hranchaw le a sehmi sa cun a khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmah cu kaan ralchanh, tiah Bawipa nih a ti. Naa porhlawtnak cu meikhu bangin dih lakin ka chuahter lai i Vainam nih na fale cu a thah hna lai. Vawlei cungah hin sa seh awk kan nganhpiak ti lai lo i Na rawl ei thawng cu theih a si ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aa! thisen aa nehmi khuapi, hlennak in aa ciahmi, ramhnak in a khat i sa sehmi cia loin a ngei zungzalmi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rang tuknak fung thawng cu ngai hmanh, Rangleng kekual an i mer thawng le rangtum an ke khawn thawng cu ngai hna hmanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rangleng hna cu an choi cukmak, rangcung ralkap hna nih cun an hun nam cutmat, An vainam cu a tleu in an tleu, an fei cu a cer in an cer! Mithi cu rel cawk an si lo, an ruak cu a pon in aa pong; a rel in rel cawk an si lo, mi nih ruak cu i pah lulhmalh an si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mah vialte hi hlawhhlangnu hlawhhlannak ruangah a si, aa dawh i eih a thiammi bawinu ruangah a si, Miphun hna le mi hna kha a a hlawhhlannak le a eihthiamnak in a hlen dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah cu kaan ralchanh, tiah Ralkapbu Bawipa nih a ti, Na hni cu na hmai tiangin kan hlim lai i Na pumlawng cu miphun kip kha ka hmuhter hna lai i na ningzahnak cu pennak kip sinah ka phozar lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah cu fihnung hmunthur in kan khuh lai i na ning kan zahter lai i ek bantuk ah kan rel lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khi tikah nangmah cu aan hmutu vialte nih an in hrial lai i, “Nineveh cu a rawk cang, aho nih dah a hnemh ti lai,” an ti lai. Nangmah hnemtu ah ahodah ka hmuh khawh hna lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No-amon khua nakin na ṭha deuh lai maw? No-amon khua cu Nail tiva i a vate hna pawngah a um i ti nih a kulhmi a si; A ralhau cu Nail tiva kha a si i a vampang cu ti kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kush le Izipt kha a thazang an si i a thazang cu dongh a hngal lo, Put le Libia nih bawmhnak kha an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No-amon zong cu ral ah a tang i sal cannak chungah an kalpi; Lam ṭe ka kip ah khan a fano tete hna cu an den dih hna i a bawi hna cu camcawhfung zuh in an i ṭhen hna i a mingan vialte hna cu cikcin in an khih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmah Nineveh zong an in kulh ve lai i an in tei lai; Na ral hna kut chungin himnak ding kha na nawl a herh ve lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ralhau hna cu a hminmi theipi bantuk an si ko, Hninh an si tikah a eitu hna kaa chungah khan an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan lak i a ummi ralkap hna cu nu bu men a si; Nan ram kutka hna cu nan ral hna hmaiah an i hung ko i An hrenhnak thingthluan hna kha mei nih a kangh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ral nih an in hren hna lai caah ti i than ong u, Nan ralhau cu fehter hna u; Tlak kha nawng u law thung kha lamh chih u, tlakrawh kha remh hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khi ti nan tuah hmanh ah mei nih an kangh ṭhiamṭhiam hna lai i vainam nih an sam ṭhiam hna lai. Khaubawk tluk tam ah i ser tuah u, buṭit tluk tam ah i ser tuah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thla a samh i a zuangmi buṭit khaubawk bu ah cun i ser tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Van i arfi zat in nan mingiatu hna cu an tam; a thli tein nan i chiahmi hna cu khaubawk zat an si, Nan ralbawi hna cu, khua kih ni i vampang i aa dormi khaubawk zat an si; Sihmanhsehlaw ni a hung chuah tikah an zuang i khuazei ah dah an loh kha ahohmanh nih an hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Assiria siangpahrang, na tuukhal hna cu an i hngilh, Na saṭil run cawngtu hna cu an it, Na ralkap hna cu tlang kip ah an i ṭhek dih i ahohmanh nih an pum hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hma cu damh khawh an si lo, naa hliamnak cu thih phu a si; Nangmah na sicannak thawng a rak theimi vialte nih lunglawmhnak in an kut an bengh. A dongh in a dong lomi na puarhrannak nih, a tongh lomi aho tal an um maw?
  </para>
</usx>
